WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 10=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.464 --> 01:43.928
The rough soldiers don't understand
the chain of command.

01:45.400 --> 01:46.519
When we lose our temper,

01:47.000 --> 01:49.159
we only know
how to take matters straight to the top.

01:50.840 --> 01:51.959
What do you mean, Fengtai?

01:55.719 --> 01:57.439
What can a bunch of rough soldiers do?

01:58.216 --> 02:01.040
If the entire barracks causes an
uproar over the Chinese New Year,

02:01.959 --> 02:03.480
Jinling is the southern capital...

02:04.328 --> 02:06.344
I'm afraid
even if you try to cover it up,

02:06.760 --> 02:07.840
you won't be able to.

02:10.000 --> 02:11.280
Word will reach His Majesty.

02:11.960 --> 02:12.800
Lin Fengtai,

02:12.919 --> 02:13.360
you...

02:18.800 --> 02:19.680
In three days,

02:20.152 --> 02:21.944
before the office
closes for the holiday,

02:22.599 --> 02:24.039
I want to see those supplies

02:24.879 --> 02:25.840
enter the barracks.

02:41.660 --> 02:44.080
(Ministry of Revenue)

02:44.080 --> 02:45.176
Take 350 taels of silver

02:45.319 --> 02:46.680
from my personal account.

02:46.776 --> 02:47.960
Use it all to buy live sheep.

02:48.008 --> 02:50.490
We'll give everyone an extra meal
tonight to keep out the cold.

02:51.360 --> 02:51.919
Yes.

02:53.864 --> 02:55.590
My mother has been wanting to meet you.

02:55.960 --> 02:57.800
Come to my home tonight
for a simple dinner.

03:00.879 --> 03:01.439
All right.

03:09.540 --> 03:11.820
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

03:22.759 --> 03:23.560
Have you all decided?

03:24.232 --> 03:25.310
- Yes.
- Yes.

03:26.159 --> 03:27.360
Then tell me one by one.

03:30.560 --> 03:31.360
Yuchan,

03:32.639 --> 03:34.960
I used to work in the tearoom.

03:35.719 --> 03:38.199
From tea leaves
and tea sets to refreshments,

03:38.504 --> 03:39.870
I wouldn't say I'm an expert,

03:39.928 --> 03:41.320
but I'm quite familiar with them.

03:42.159 --> 03:44.039
I'd like to continue
working in the tearoom.

03:45.479 --> 03:46.039
All right.

03:46.520 --> 03:48.159
You can continue managing the tearoom.

03:49.208 --> 03:50.312
Thank you, Yuchan.

03:50.599 --> 03:51.599
I'll do my best.

03:56.319 --> 03:57.199
Yuchan,

03:57.368 --> 03:59.470
when my mother
served in First Madam's courtyard,

03:59.480 --> 04:01.224
she was in charge
of the flowers and plants.

04:01.439 --> 04:03.039
I grew up learning from her

04:03.039 --> 04:04.560
how to tend plants and arrange flowers.

04:05.599 --> 04:08.759
I'd like to take care
of the plants at Zhichun Hall.

04:09.479 --> 04:11.639
Then I'll leave the plants
at Zhichun Hall to you.

04:11.816 --> 04:13.736
They've been neglected
for the past few years,

04:13.740 --> 04:15.224
and many have fallen into disrepair.

04:15.599 --> 04:17.120
If you can restore Zhichun Hall

04:17.120 --> 04:19.128
to its former abundance
of flowers and greenery,

04:19.560 --> 04:22.759
First Madam
and Young Master will reward you.

04:24.120 --> 04:24.959
Thank you, Yuchan.

04:25.439 --> 04:26.600
I'll do my very best.

04:28.600 --> 04:29.480
Yuchan,

04:30.000 --> 04:32.160
my grandmother taught me
needlework from an early age,

04:32.600 --> 04:33.759
but I'm no good at it.

04:34.360 --> 04:36.360
When I was a third-class maid,

04:36.360 --> 04:37.560
I helped out in the kitchen.

04:38.160 --> 04:40.600
The cook said my nose
was keener than a dog's.

04:40.648 --> 04:41.752
No matter what was cooking,

04:41.816 --> 04:43.560
I could smell it
even from the underworld.

04:44.240 --> 04:47.160
She also said
all my memory must be in my tongue.

04:47.319 --> 04:48.560
Once I've tasted something,

04:48.570 --> 04:51.224
I wouldn't forget it even after
drinking the Soup of Forgetfulness.

04:55.079 --> 04:55.839
She also...

04:56.240 --> 05:00.040
Also said I have an appetite like a pig.

05:00.199 --> 05:02.560
I could even taste
every flavor in bean dregs.

05:03.199 --> 05:04.399
What a simpleton.

05:04.439 --> 05:05.560
Was she really praising her?

05:06.120 --> 05:07.399
You've said all that,

05:07.680 --> 05:10.399
but you still haven't told me
what you know how to do,

05:10.439 --> 05:11.439
what you can do,

05:11.439 --> 05:12.480
or what you want to do.

05:14.319 --> 05:15.079
I...

05:15.759 --> 05:16.519
It's nothing

05:16.519 --> 05:17.600
to be ashamed of.

05:18.240 --> 05:19.040
Speak up.

05:21.240 --> 05:22.519
I know how to eat.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.800
I can eat a lot.

05:24.639 --> 05:25.759
And I want to eat.

05:29.439 --> 05:31.000
What's there to be embarrassed about?

05:31.560 --> 05:33.279
Food is the first necessity
for the people.

05:33.639 --> 05:35.279
For now, stay by my side

05:35.360 --> 05:37.480
and learn how to manage
Young Master's meals

05:37.480 --> 05:39.000
and prepare banquets for his guests.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.920
In time, you'll be put
in charge of the private kitchen.

05:47.639 --> 05:48.639
Thank you, Yuchan.

05:48.839 --> 05:50.160
I'll study hard.

05:54.360 --> 05:55.120
Lanxiang,

05:55.639 --> 05:56.800
have you decided?

05:59.839 --> 06:01.720
That stubborn girl.

06:04.800 --> 06:05.800
Yuchan,

06:06.160 --> 06:09.519
I can cook, clean, do laundry, and sew,

06:10.120 --> 06:11.399
but I only know the basics.

06:11.759 --> 06:13.120
I'm not even as good as my mother,

06:13.192 --> 06:15.256
so I certainly
can't say I'm skilled at any of them.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.079
I can read.

06:20.399 --> 06:21.759
If you don't mind,

06:22.040 --> 06:24.600
I'd like to clean
and organize the inner study each day.

06:30.639 --> 06:31.439
It seems

06:32.040 --> 06:33.600
you've kept your literacy

06:34.319 --> 06:35.560
well hidden.

06:37.928 --> 06:40.250
When I first entered
the residence and answered questions,

06:40.260 --> 06:42.030
Young Lady Zhao
thought I was too long-winded

06:42.040 --> 06:43.390
and didn't let me finish.

06:43.800 --> 06:44.519
Later,

06:44.920 --> 06:46.600
I didn't think it was important,

06:46.879 --> 06:48.199
so I never mentioned it again.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.160
I would never deceive my master.

06:50.270 --> 06:51.768
Before I even entered the residence,

06:51.816 --> 06:54.600
Old Master already knew I could read.

06:58.319 --> 06:59.360
Can you write?

07:00.568 --> 07:02.830
I used to copy sutras
with the nuns at the convent.

07:03.000 --> 07:03.759
I can write,

07:04.040 --> 07:05.879
but my handwriting isn't very good.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.279
As long as you can write.

07:10.040 --> 07:12.720
From now on, you'll
be in charge of the inner study.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.800
It's the most important place
in Zhichun Hall.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.360
If anything goes wrong,

07:19.000 --> 07:20.120
you'll be severely punished.

07:22.720 --> 07:23.480
Yes.

07:30.392 --> 07:31.870
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

07:37.120 --> 07:37.879
You may go.

07:44.744 --> 07:47.500
First Madam thought Young Master
wouldn't return for a few more days,

07:47.510 --> 07:49.610
after the government offices
closed for the holiday.

07:49.639 --> 07:51.410
She only instructed
the private kitchen today

07:51.420 --> 07:52.790
to prepare some dishes for tasting.

07:52.888 --> 07:54.350
I've invited a friend over for dinner.

07:54.360 --> 07:56.600
It's a good chance for him
to pay his respects to Mother.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.160
Five Willow Fish.

08:15.336 --> 08:18.136
The main ingredient is black-backed
green carp from Wulong Pond.

08:18.216 --> 08:19.688
The accompanying ingredients are

08:19.720 --> 08:23.600
winter mushrooms, winter bamboo shoots,
pickled ginger, and pickled cucumber.

08:25.959 --> 08:27.120
Braised Double Duck.

08:27.310 --> 08:28.456
The main ingredients are

08:28.504 --> 08:30.680
half a roast duck and half a white duck.

08:30.776 --> 08:32.616
The accompanying ingredients are

08:32.680 --> 08:34.408
cooked ham
and rehydrated winter mushrooms.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.919
Jinqi should've sent someone ahead

08:50.919 --> 08:52.159
to let us know you were coming.

08:52.600 --> 08:53.759
We had so little time,

08:53.784 --> 08:55.240
so we couldn't prepare many dishes.

08:55.639 --> 08:57.960
I hope you won't mind the simple fare.

08:59.240 --> 09:00.720
This is already quite a feast.

09:01.120 --> 09:01.879
Madam,

09:02.159 --> 09:03.399
back when we were in the army,

09:03.480 --> 09:04.240
if we could get

09:04.240 --> 09:05.759
a bowl of piping hot meat soup, then...

09:09.440 --> 09:10.759
I knew it. You've always

09:10.759 --> 09:11.799
been fooling me,

09:12.088 --> 09:14.240
saying you feasted on fish
and meat in the barracks.

09:14.270 --> 09:15.448
There were so many of you,

09:15.496 --> 09:17.816
and you said everyone
ate well and enjoyed their meals.

09:23.159 --> 09:24.159
You're a grown man.

09:24.840 --> 09:25.799
Aren't you embarrassed?

09:28.960 --> 09:30.120
Don't follow his example.

09:30.840 --> 09:31.840
Take your time.

09:32.159 --> 09:32.960
Thank you, Madam.

09:37.240 --> 09:39.000
Jinqi is my only son.

09:40.159 --> 09:41.480
You saved Jinqi,

09:42.000 --> 09:43.519
so you saved my life.

09:44.639 --> 09:45.480
From now on,

09:46.240 --> 09:47.960
treat this place as your own home.

09:49.240 --> 09:50.799
Once your sister moves in,

09:51.000 --> 09:52.799
she'll be a young lady
of the Lin family.

09:57.159 --> 09:58.200
Our parents passed away,

09:58.728 --> 10:01.464
so my sister and I have depended
on each other since childhood.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.039
As long as she's well,

10:03.759 --> 10:04.799
I'm well.

10:05.176 --> 10:07.624
We're family.
There's no need for such formalities.

10:08.000 --> 10:08.879
Come, sit down.

10:14.279 --> 10:15.399
You're such

10:15.576 --> 10:16.910
a loyal and devoted young man.

10:17.519 --> 10:19.799
The more I see of you,
the more I like you.

10:20.759 --> 10:21.559
Have some more.

10:23.919 --> 10:24.679
Mother,

10:25.399 --> 10:26.799
look at your son, too.

10:27.384 --> 10:28.552
Give your son some meat.

10:30.000 --> 10:31.519
Put your bowl down.

10:31.960 --> 10:32.960
If your father sees you,

10:33.200 --> 10:35.279
he'll say I've spoiled my son

10:35.280 --> 10:36.340
beyond all propriety again.

10:38.159 --> 10:39.799
Stop making that ridiculous face.

10:41.280 --> 10:42.344
Mother, you have some, too.

10:42.408 --> 10:43.710
Ever since Young Master returned,

10:43.720 --> 10:45.279
(Yinchen, Madam Qin's first-class maid)
Madam has been laughing much more.

10:45.639 --> 10:46.799
Young Master is very filial.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.440
He knows Madam has been upset

10:48.440 --> 10:49.720
about his marriage,

10:49.840 --> 10:52.039
so he's been doing everything
he can to cheer her up.

10:54.639 --> 10:55.399
Lanxiang.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.080
How did it go?

11:00.159 --> 11:02.639
Were First Madam and Young Master
happy with today's banquet?

11:04.519 --> 11:06.080
Whether they were satisfied or not,

11:07.279 --> 11:08.320
I don't know.

11:12.720 --> 11:15.639
But Madam and Young Master
were both all smiles.

11:17.279 --> 11:18.320
What about the guest?

11:19.120 --> 11:20.840
He seemed easygoing.

11:20.870 --> 11:22.184
I'm sure there was no problem.

11:28.279 --> 11:29.799
My family is moving today.

11:30.879 --> 11:33.320
Guess where we're moving to.

11:35.600 --> 11:37.279
Don't tell me it's our courtyard.

11:38.200 --> 11:40.120
Last time my mother
went to see your parents,

11:40.130 --> 11:41.850
she noticed the place
next door was vacant.

11:41.860 --> 11:43.688
When she came back,
she told my grandmother.

11:44.879 --> 11:47.360
But the houses
in our courtyard are all old.

11:47.390 --> 11:49.192
They're damp in summer
and cold in winter.

11:50.799 --> 11:51.919
My grandmother said

11:52.030 --> 11:53.672
she doesn't mind the houses being old.

11:53.736 --> 11:56.320
What matters most
is having good neighbors.

11:57.000 --> 11:59.440
Besides, there's
a well in the courtyard.

11:59.720 --> 12:00.790
The water may be bitter,

12:00.856 --> 12:01.790
but it's still usable.

12:04.120 --> 12:05.879
Then we'll be neighbors from now on.

12:06.159 --> 12:07.799
My parents will be delighted.

12:16.279 --> 12:17.039
Wujiu,

12:17.080 --> 12:17.720
hurry up.

12:17.759 --> 12:19.080
Dinner's ready. Come and eat.

12:19.840 --> 12:20.639
Coming.

12:28.600 --> 12:29.879
Xiaolian's grandmother.

12:31.679 --> 12:32.840
Xiaolian's grandmother.

12:35.080 --> 12:35.879
You're here.

12:36.039 --> 12:36.720
(Mai Lanzi)
Close the door.

12:36.799 --> 12:38.919
(Du Xiaolian's grandmother)
I figured you just moved in today,

12:39.080 --> 12:41.440
and you still have
to go to work tonight.

12:41.768 --> 12:43.480
You probably wouldn't have time to cook,

12:44.159 --> 12:45.320
so I made some extra food.

12:46.039 --> 12:47.519
You shouldn't have.

12:48.000 --> 12:49.480
You should keep it for yourselves.

12:49.679 --> 12:51.879
We've often troubled Xiaolian's mother

12:51.879 --> 12:53.519
to pass messages to Lanxiang for us.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.919
And from now on, we may still

12:55.919 --> 12:57.320
have to trouble you quite often.

12:57.399 --> 12:58.279
It's no trouble.

12:59.879 --> 13:01.320
Then we won't stand on ceremony.

13:01.480 --> 13:02.919
Yes, hurry and eat.

13:03.080 --> 13:03.960
Eat while it's hot.

13:04.039 --> 13:05.480
You can finish unpacking afterward.

13:05.519 --> 13:07.679
If you ever have any heavy work to do,

13:07.919 --> 13:08.879
and Dasong isn't around,

13:09.120 --> 13:10.720
just call Xu over to help.

13:11.639 --> 13:12.480
Thank you.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.600
Go eat. I'm leaving.

13:15.279 --> 13:16.200
Take care.

13:16.424 --> 13:17.688
No need to see me out.

13:21.240 --> 13:23.320
No wonder Xiaolian likes their daughter.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.720
They're honest people.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.399
They remember every kindness.

13:48.200 --> 13:49.000
Try some.

13:49.639 --> 13:51.039
Why did you buy liquor?

13:51.399 --> 13:52.600
What a waste of money.

13:53.000 --> 13:54.480
I didn't buy it.

13:54.879 --> 13:56.080
It was a treat.

13:56.879 --> 13:58.960
Head Shopkeeper Huang and his family

13:59.120 --> 14:01.096
suddenly said
they were moving to the estate.

14:01.639 --> 14:04.000
So Second Shopkeeper He
was promoted to head shopkeeper.

14:04.279 --> 14:05.600
He treated everyone to drinks.

14:05.759 --> 14:06.840
Why would he suddenly

14:06.840 --> 14:08.480
give up his position at the shop

14:08.799 --> 14:09.720
and move to the estate?

14:11.000 --> 14:13.840
It seems that when
Young Madam was in charge,

14:14.000 --> 14:15.320
he made a mistake.

14:16.039 --> 14:18.480
Luckily, Young Master
dealt with him leniently.

14:18.639 --> 14:19.519
Otherwise,

14:19.608 --> 14:22.550
he would've ended up like Shopkeeper Liu
of the rice shop and his family,

14:22.799 --> 14:24.240
tied up and sold off.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.600
Tell me,

14:27.016 --> 14:28.790
how could
a perfectly good married couple

14:29.320 --> 14:32.080
suddenly decide to separate?

14:34.559 --> 14:35.879
Aren't you going to ask

14:36.480 --> 14:38.759
who'll be the next second shopkeeper?

14:41.000 --> 14:42.639
Who's the second shopkeeper?

14:45.440 --> 14:46.720
Starting today,

14:47.000 --> 14:50.279
you may call me Second Shopkeeper Xu.

14:53.600 --> 14:54.279
Really?

14:54.320 --> 14:55.720
Of course it's true.

14:55.759 --> 14:57.279
Everyone at the shop today

14:57.320 --> 14:58.600
respectfully

14:58.600 --> 15:00.240
called me Second Shopkeeper.

15:05.879 --> 15:06.879
Much obliged.

15:08.080 --> 15:09.600
Who knows? One day,

15:10.600 --> 15:13.480
I might become head shopkeeper.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.639
Stop dreaming.

15:17.200 --> 15:17.960
Think about it.

15:18.360 --> 15:19.600
If it were really about ability,

15:20.080 --> 15:21.720
was Head Shopkeeper Huang incompetent?

15:23.000 --> 15:25.840
Was Shopkeeper Liu
of the rice shop incompetent?

15:26.279 --> 15:28.399
Yet everything changed overnight.

15:28.799 --> 15:31.159
One family was sent off to the estate,

15:31.200 --> 15:33.320
and the other was sold off.

15:33.519 --> 15:35.320
Even their children suffered for it.

15:37.440 --> 15:39.919
I'm only celebrating here at home.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.159
Don't worry.

15:41.200 --> 15:42.840
I'll be careful in everything I do.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.856
I won't ever get Lanxiang
dragged into trouble.

15:48.720 --> 15:49.480
I don't care

15:49.720 --> 15:52.879
whether you're a head shopkeeper
or a second shopkeeper.

15:53.600 --> 15:54.679
All I want

15:54.840 --> 15:56.480
is for you to handle things carefully

15:56.919 --> 15:58.679
and for Lanxiang to stay safe.

16:18.200 --> 16:19.279
That smells wonderful.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.480
Is this fresh tea?

16:20.519 --> 16:21.159
Yes.

16:23.120 --> 16:23.799
Not bad, right?

16:26.559 --> 16:27.919
Come in and warm yourself up.

16:28.392 --> 16:29.550
Have a bowl of hot tea.

16:29.840 --> 16:30.639
Take a break.

16:31.368 --> 16:32.296
Yuchan took Xiaolian

16:32.360 --> 16:34.820
to the side gate to welcome
Young Lady Du into the residence.

16:35.039 --> 16:36.360
They should be back soon.

16:43.919 --> 16:45.000
Yuchan is back?

16:45.080 --> 16:46.232
Would she like some hot tea?

16:47.240 --> 16:49.200
Yuchan accompanied Young Lady Du

16:49.320 --> 16:50.480
to First Madam's quarters

16:50.519 --> 16:51.879
to pay her respects to First Madam.

16:51.928 --> 16:54.030
She'll probably have
to kowtow to Old Madam as well.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.679
She won't be back anytime soon.

16:58.600 --> 16:59.240
Come on.

17:10.119 --> 17:10.839
Guess

17:11.359 --> 17:13.880
what Young Lady Du looks like.

17:18.088 --> 17:20.350
The Du family is registered
as a military household.

17:20.559 --> 17:22.960
Could she be a woman warrior?

17:30.960 --> 17:34.319
Young Lady Du is fair and slender.

17:35.079 --> 17:36.960
She's very pretty.

17:37.319 --> 17:38.880
She has a lovely way of speaking.

17:39.440 --> 17:42.160
She carries herself beautifully.

17:42.680 --> 17:44.559
And she's very courteous and polite.

17:46.119 --> 17:47.160
I can't quite describe it.

17:47.200 --> 17:49.480
She's just very likable.

17:50.680 --> 17:51.440
Look.

17:52.599 --> 17:54.599
Yuchan.

17:59.759 --> 18:01.039
You don't need to stand up.

18:08.039 --> 18:08.920
Yuchan.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.279
Since you like Young Lady Du so much,

18:14.319 --> 18:16.640
why don't you
go serve her at Luxue Lodge?

18:19.519 --> 18:20.279
Yuchan,

18:21.480 --> 18:23.079
I won't do it again.

18:28.039 --> 18:28.920
All right.

18:29.359 --> 18:30.400
I'm not punishing you.

18:31.720 --> 18:33.519
Young Lady Du brought one maid

18:33.544 --> 18:34.640
and one older servant woman.

18:34.696 --> 18:36.410
That's enough
to attend to her personally.

18:36.550 --> 18:38.216
But she's unfamiliar with the residence.

18:38.319 --> 18:40.319
First Madam is worried
she might need something

18:40.440 --> 18:41.519
but feels too shy to ask.

18:41.920 --> 18:43.519
So she asked me to find a lively maid

18:43.559 --> 18:44.640
to go to Luxue Lodge.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.680
I'd already planned to send you.

18:46.968 --> 18:48.830
You'll only
be assigned there for a year or so.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.599
You'll still belong to Zhichun Hall.

18:57.440 --> 18:58.039
All right.

18:58.559 --> 18:59.319
I'll go.

19:00.079 --> 19:01.440
Young Lady Du's brother

19:01.550 --> 19:03.080
once took a blade for Young Master.

19:03.480 --> 19:06.480
Young Master and First Madam
are both deeply grateful.

19:07.559 --> 19:08.319
Remember,

19:08.720 --> 19:11.200
you're being sent there
by Young Master and First Madam.

19:11.880 --> 19:14.079
If any thoughtless maids
or servant women

19:14.079 --> 19:16.200
look down on the poor
or shirk difficult work,

19:16.640 --> 19:19.079
you need to assert yourself
and put them in their place.

19:20.279 --> 19:22.480
If you can't handle them, come to me.

19:23.480 --> 19:24.359
Don't worry, Yuchan.

19:24.440 --> 19:25.960
I'll take good care of Young Lady Du.

19:26.008 --> 19:27.920
I won't let her suffer
the slightest grievance.

19:46.519 --> 19:47.319
Young Lady Du,

19:47.640 --> 19:48.680
watch your step.

19:48.920 --> 19:49.480
All right.

19:52.920 --> 19:54.119
Young Lady Du is here.

19:59.340 --> 20:03.700
(Du Cuique, Du Zheng's younger sister)

20:06.024 --> 20:07.160
First Madam, Second Madam,

20:07.310 --> 20:09.976
and the Second, Third,
and Fourth Young Ladies are all inside.

20:10.880 --> 20:11.839
Thank you.

20:24.936 --> 20:27.688
(Lingdang, Du Cuique's personal maid)
First Madam, Second Madam.

20:29.992 --> 20:33.064
(Wang Lingxiao, Second Madam of
the Lin family, Lin Jinqi's second aunt)

20:34.480 --> 20:36.720
This is the snow pear
and loquat paste I made.

20:37.200 --> 20:38.440
It's perfect for winter.

20:38.488 --> 20:40.240
It nourishes the lungs
and replenishes yin.

20:46.960 --> 20:47.960
Young Lady Du is here.

20:47.960 --> 20:50.210
(Lin Xiushu, Madam Qin's daughter,
Fourth Young Lady of the Lin family)

20:50.220 --> 20:53.050
(Lin Xiuwan, Madam Wang's daughter,
Second Young Lady of the Lin family)

20:53.060 --> 20:55.128
(Lin Xiuru, daughter
of Lin Changzheng's concubine)

20:55.130 --> 20:56.550
(Third Young Lady of the Lin family)

20:57.192 --> 20:59.880
(Snow Pear and Loquat Paste)
Did you write this?

21:01.039 --> 21:01.640
Yes.

21:02.184 --> 21:04.200
When I studied
herbal medicine with my teacher,

21:04.264 --> 21:05.990
I practiced calligraphy
for several years.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.640
Your handwriting is excellent.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.039
It's clear

21:09.279 --> 21:10.880
you put a lot of effort into it.

21:11.839 --> 21:12.640
Wonderful.

21:13.160 --> 21:14.039
Wonderful.

21:15.119 --> 21:17.839
The more I see of this girl,
the more I like her.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.759
If our Wan

21:20.000 --> 21:22.039
were half as thoughtful
and capable as you,

21:22.680 --> 21:23.720
I'd be smiling

21:23.759 --> 21:25.039
even in my dreams.

21:29.039 --> 21:29.599
Look at her.

21:30.240 --> 21:32.240
I must have spoiled this girl rotten.

21:34.079 --> 21:35.079
Good girl,

21:35.559 --> 21:36.920
don't mind us.

21:37.119 --> 21:39.039
Go have fun with the other girls.

21:39.359 --> 21:39.839
Go on.

21:39.920 --> 21:40.400
Go on.

21:41.519 --> 21:42.160
Yes.

21:47.200 --> 21:47.839
Cuique,

21:47.960 --> 21:48.599
come over here.

21:48.759 --> 21:49.519
Cuique.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.759
What are you making, Xiuru?

21:55.656 --> 21:57.640
Old Madam asked us
to make some festive ornaments.

21:57.759 --> 21:59.359
On the seventh day, the Festival of Man,

21:59.400 --> 22:01.672
we can give them to our elders,
relatives, and friends.

22:02.880 --> 22:03.880
I ruined another one.

22:04.759 --> 22:05.440
I give up.

22:06.240 --> 22:06.920
Xiuwan,

22:07.400 --> 22:08.200
let me help you.

22:08.839 --> 22:09.599
You?

22:11.920 --> 22:13.039
Forget it.

22:13.279 --> 22:14.559
You're even worse than I am.

22:19.559 --> 22:21.759
Old Madam gave us so many materials.

22:22.160 --> 22:23.559
If we can't make anything,

22:23.560 --> 22:25.200
I'm afraid we'll spend all of next year

22:25.200 --> 22:27.200
confined to our rooms
learning needlework.

22:27.519 --> 22:28.720
Old Madam has a soft heart.

22:29.119 --> 22:30.400
We'll just coax her

22:30.640 --> 22:32.839
and say a few sweet words.
We'll be fine.

22:33.599 --> 22:34.799
Old Master...

22:41.279 --> 22:42.440
Would you like me to help?

22:44.640 --> 22:45.759
You know how to make them?

22:46.568 --> 22:48.260
My family was poor
when I was growing up.

22:48.456 --> 22:50.248
During festivals, we had nothing special

22:50.296 --> 22:51.880
to give our relatives and friends.

22:51.992 --> 22:54.780
I only made flower ornaments and
paper figures for the Festival of Man.

22:54.799 --> 22:56.880
After making so many,
I naturally learned how.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.880
Please make one for me.

23:00.000 --> 23:00.440
All right.

23:24.240 --> 23:24.920
Done.

23:29.759 --> 23:30.920
Let me see.

23:33.559 --> 23:34.759
That's amazing.

23:35.000 --> 23:35.799
Please, Cuique.

23:35.920 --> 23:37.640
I'd like a silk flower I can wear.

23:38.079 --> 23:38.960
A silk flower?

23:39.750 --> 23:40.264
All right.

23:57.640 --> 23:58.319
Xiuwan.

24:01.440 --> 24:02.279
Xiuru.

24:04.799 --> 24:06.160
This one is for Xiushu.

24:07.720 --> 24:08.519
Do you like it?

24:12.359 --> 24:13.599
Can you make paper figures?

24:14.279 --> 24:14.839
Yes.

24:15.319 --> 24:16.400
Then teach me.

24:17.079 --> 24:19.119
I want to make Old Madam

24:19.176 --> 24:21.680
the Old Man of the South Pole
holding a peach of immortality.

24:21.839 --> 24:22.279
All right.

24:22.720 --> 24:24.000
Me too.

24:24.480 --> 24:25.079
All right.

24:25.240 --> 24:26.200
Make mine first.

24:27.680 --> 24:28.039
Careful.

24:28.039 --> 24:28.960
It's a pity

24:30.640 --> 24:33.799
the Du siblings come
from a military household.

24:34.279 --> 24:35.119
You know,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.519
you're worried about Jinqi's marriage,

24:37.839 --> 24:39.960
and I'm worried about Wan's marriage.

24:41.000 --> 24:42.240
If only the Du siblings

24:42.279 --> 24:44.559
came from a more prominent family,

24:45.200 --> 24:46.160
at least one of us

24:46.279 --> 24:48.480
would have nothing to worry about.

24:48.880 --> 24:50.319
What nonsense are you talking about?

24:50.640 --> 24:52.039
The children might hear you.

24:52.559 --> 24:53.279
Xuemei,

24:53.839 --> 24:55.240
aren't you worried

24:55.240 --> 24:56.328
about Jinqi's marriage?

24:59.039 --> 24:59.720
Of course I am.

24:59.920 --> 25:00.759
Exactly.

25:02.599 --> 25:04.000
But for the next year or so,

25:04.279 --> 25:05.519
all I can do is worry.

25:06.519 --> 25:07.839
Old Master said

25:08.000 --> 25:10.880
I must wait until the matter
with the Zhao family is settled

25:11.279 --> 25:12.880
before I can look for a match for Jinqi.

25:20.039 --> 25:21.319
What's more pressing now

25:21.519 --> 25:24.119
is finding a good match
for Young Lady Du.

25:24.584 --> 25:26.920
Only then will we have fulfilled
our promise to Du Zheng.

25:28.640 --> 25:31.359
Since Jinqi has chosen this path,

25:31.640 --> 25:34.000
I'll feel more at ease
if he has a capable

25:34.359 --> 25:35.759
and loyal subordinate by his side.

25:35.759 --> 25:37.559
But really, Du Zheng...

25:38.160 --> 25:39.880
Even though their parents are gone,

25:40.039 --> 25:41.559
an elder brother is like a father.

25:41.704 --> 25:43.400
How could he let
his sister reach nineteen

25:43.432 --> 25:44.920
without arranging a marriage for her?

25:44.920 --> 25:46.559
You can't blame Du Zheng for that.

25:47.279 --> 25:49.400
Young Lady Du originally
wanted to enter the palace.

25:49.512 --> 25:51.800
With her background,
she could become an imperial consort?

25:57.720 --> 26:00.559
Young Lady Du wanted to enter
the palace as a palace maid

26:00.792 --> 26:03.528
and serve in the Six Bureaus
and Twenty-Four Offices.

26:03.720 --> 26:06.160
If she could become
a Records Keeper or Registrar,

26:06.559 --> 26:08.640
she'd hold a proper
Eighth-Rank or Seventh-Rank post.

26:09.624 --> 26:12.216
And that's nothing compared
with a Fifth-Rank Palace Secretary.

26:13.079 --> 26:15.119
Even noble consorts
and grand secretaries

26:15.240 --> 26:17.000
would have to treat her with respect.

26:17.112 --> 26:18.360
I never imagined Young Lady Du

26:18.400 --> 26:20.079
had such lofty ambitions.

26:20.280 --> 26:22.136
She wanted to become a female official?

26:22.640 --> 26:24.440
Unfortunately,
the times were against her.

26:25.224 --> 26:27.240
Female officials
have little influence these days.

26:27.736 --> 26:29.816
Du Zheng couldn't bear
to send his sister away,

26:29.912 --> 26:31.260
and after one delay after another,

26:31.759 --> 26:33.119
her marriage was put off until now.

26:34.200 --> 26:34.960
No wonder.

26:36.000 --> 26:36.599
No wonder.

26:36.799 --> 26:37.400
Done.

26:39.519 --> 26:40.160
Please, Cuique.

26:40.279 --> 26:42.000
I want a big peony.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.559
And I want a swift horse.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.440
Your horse...

26:44.440 --> 26:45.759
Make mine first.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.599
My horse is easy to make.

26:47.799 --> 26:49.079
Look at Young Lady Du.

26:49.720 --> 26:52.240
She's beautiful and gentle,

26:53.200 --> 26:55.599
well-read, knowledgeable
about herbal medicine,

26:55.600 --> 26:56.792
and skilled at needlework.

26:58.079 --> 27:01.000
Now, with the Lin family's support,

27:01.848 --> 27:03.790
she'll surely
find a match she's happy with.

27:03.848 --> 27:05.848
While visiting people
over the Chinese New Year,

27:05.880 --> 27:09.720
ask around and find her a suitable match
as soon as possible.

27:12.200 --> 27:14.319
Have you found a match for Wan yet?

27:14.680 --> 27:15.599
Xuemei,

27:15.600 --> 27:17.640
that's exactly
what I wanted to talk to you about.

27:18.519 --> 27:20.839
I'm worried sick over Wan.

27:22.660 --> 27:25.580
(Lin Jinqi's Inner Study)

27:25.580 --> 27:27.460
(Respectfully Presented by Lin Jinqi)

27:41.540 --> 27:45.620
(Best Wishes for a Joyous Spring)

27:51.380 --> 27:53.620
(Lin)

27:59.079 --> 27:59.720
Young Master,

27:59.799 --> 28:00.839
Young Lady Du is here.

28:05.039 --> 28:05.680
Young Lady Du,

28:05.799 --> 28:06.680
please come in.

28:11.960 --> 28:14.310
Thank you for taking me in
and looking after me,

28:15.200 --> 28:16.759
I have nothing valuable to give you.

28:17.279 --> 28:18.400
So I made use of what I had

28:18.504 --> 28:20.640
and made some inexpensive festive ornaments.
[*Festive ornaments were popular New Year decorations in ancient China]

28:20.728 --> 28:22.456
It's just a small token
of my appreciation.

28:28.559 --> 28:29.799
That's very thoughtful of you.

28:30.640 --> 28:33.160
Are you settling in well at Luxue Lodge?

28:34.440 --> 28:36.079
Old Madam and First Madam

28:36.232 --> 28:37.830
have both taken excellent care of me.

28:37.944 --> 28:40.888
Even the food, clothing, and daily
necessities are far better than at home.

28:40.890 --> 28:42.759
It took some getting used to at first,

28:43.464 --> 28:45.270
but it's easy
to grow accustomed to comfort,

28:45.319 --> 28:46.920
so I soon settled in.

28:50.519 --> 28:53.000
No wonder Congyi is
always singing his sister's praises.

28:54.200 --> 28:55.720
You're open and forthright,

28:56.160 --> 28:57.319
more so than many men.

28:58.279 --> 28:58.839
Have a seat.

29:00.420 --> 29:02.430
You have so much
to attend to before the New Year,

29:02.440 --> 29:03.200
Jinqi.

29:03.599 --> 29:04.759
I won't keep you any longer.

29:08.559 --> 29:09.240
Lanxiang,

29:09.279 --> 29:10.359
see Young Lady Du out.

29:25.799 --> 29:27.480
Young Lady Du
may say they're inexpensive,

29:28.000 --> 29:30.440
but in the hands of someone
who appreciates the craftsmanship,

29:32.079 --> 29:33.440
they could fetch a decent price

29:33.440 --> 29:35.224
at the market before
the Chinese New Year.

29:39.119 --> 29:39.920
Lanxiang,

29:41.079 --> 29:43.119
put these on the windows.

29:45.400 --> 29:47.680
Put this pair on the screen.

29:49.799 --> 29:51.559
Take this one back to the bedroom.

29:51.640 --> 29:52.480
On the seventh day,

29:52.490 --> 29:53.990
it'll be perfect to wear in the hair.

29:54.559 --> 29:55.720
Baogai made some paste.

29:55.839 --> 29:58.119
I'll go get some so we can
put up the flower ornaments.

30:04.799 --> 30:05.400
Baogai,

30:07.064 --> 30:08.960
I was just coming
to get some paste from you,

30:09.319 --> 30:10.440
and here you are.

30:12.359 --> 30:13.519
What are you delivering?

30:14.240 --> 30:15.160
I'll take it for you.

30:15.559 --> 30:16.680
Take the paste back first.

30:16.680 --> 30:18.220
It won't work as well once it gets cold.

30:18.720 --> 30:19.160
All right.

30:20.920 --> 30:23.000
These are flower ornaments
Young Lady Du made.

30:23.010 --> 30:25.270
Give them to Madam Han first
and have her put them away.

30:25.319 --> 30:27.780
Yuchan said they'll be needed
for the Festival of Man.

30:27.799 --> 30:28.240
All right.

30:36.712 --> 30:38.550
From what I've seen these past few days,

30:38.880 --> 30:40.640
Xiaolian probably doesn't know anything.

30:41.359 --> 30:42.519
As for Lanxiang,

30:43.359 --> 30:44.119
it's hard to say.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.759
That girl is discreet and cautious.

30:47.759 --> 30:49.319
She knows how to keep things to herself.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.799
Jiugao has always suspected she knows.

31:00.248 --> 31:01.590
Even if she does know something,

31:01.960 --> 31:03.976
there's no need
to pursue it any further.

31:09.960 --> 31:11.240
You mean...

31:12.376 --> 31:14.160
Whether my separation
from Young Lady Zhao

31:15.079 --> 31:16.000
was my fault

31:16.880 --> 31:18.160
or hers?

31:19.079 --> 31:20.400
Of course it was her fault.

31:21.599 --> 31:22.759
Since she was at fault,

31:26.599 --> 31:28.039
why should I fear anyone finding out?

31:29.480 --> 31:30.119
But...

31:30.160 --> 31:30.880
Besides,

31:31.128 --> 31:32.160
you said it yourself.

31:32.728 --> 31:34.480
She knows how to keep things to herself.

31:35.640 --> 31:37.079
She knows what's at stake.

31:37.256 --> 31:38.720
Even if she's figured something out,

31:39.200 --> 31:40.359
she won't say anything.

31:42.600 --> 31:44.030
The Chinese New Year is almost here.

31:44.824 --> 31:46.200
Whatever happened in the past,

31:48.480 --> 31:49.880
let it stay in the past.

31:54.359 --> 31:55.240
In the new year,

31:56.079 --> 31:57.400
everything begins anew.

32:24.792 --> 32:26.000
On Chinese New Year's Eve,

32:26.488 --> 32:28.312
I'll go to Old Master
and Old Madam's quarters

32:28.320 --> 32:30.480
and stay up with them
to welcome the Chinese New Year.

32:30.640 --> 32:31.880
You stay here at Zhichun Hall

32:31.992 --> 32:33.270
and enjoy the Chinese New Year.

32:37.440 --> 32:39.799
They say Young Master
became ruthless after spending

32:39.799 --> 32:41.279
several years in the army.

32:41.920 --> 32:44.160
But I think Young Master
is still the same as ever.

32:46.540 --> 32:48.940
(Best Wishes for a Joyous Spring, Lin)

32:49.559 --> 32:50.440
(Fortune)
Lanxiang.

32:51.000 --> 32:51.759
Thank you.

32:51.799 --> 32:52.559
You're here.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.440
Hua. Do you know
how to play cat's cradle?

32:54.440 --> 32:55.200
Sure.

32:56.359 --> 32:57.480
I want an apple.

32:57.848 --> 32:58.510
Put it here.

33:09.480 --> 33:10.400
There, put it there.

33:10.480 --> 33:10.936
All right.

33:11.960 --> 33:13.799
Lanxiang, teach me.

33:14.839 --> 33:15.599
Here.

33:17.039 --> 33:17.799
Pastries.

33:17.799 --> 33:19.039
Yuchan, play with me.

33:19.039 --> 33:19.680
Come on.

33:19.680 --> 33:21.000
I'll give you one more chance.

33:21.480 --> 33:22.799
Lanxiang taught me.

33:26.056 --> 33:27.310
It's almost the fifth watch.

33:27.720 --> 33:28.920
Let's go toss for fortune.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.880
Do we have to do it, too?

33:31.032 --> 33:33.030
The bolt on our courtyard gate
is pretty heavy.

33:33.079 --> 33:35.740
Even if we can lift it,
we won't be able to toss it very high.

33:35.759 --> 33:36.880
That's right.

33:36.952 --> 33:37.880
I'm not very strong.

33:37.880 --> 33:39.200
I definitely can't toss it high.

33:41.359 --> 33:42.680
If one person can't toss it high,

33:42.680 --> 33:44.400
can't two people do it together?

33:45.480 --> 33:46.599
Who's doing it with me?

33:50.839 --> 33:51.599
I will.

33:51.799 --> 33:53.799
I'll join you
and try for some good luck.

33:55.839 --> 33:56.839
Bring the gate bolt over.

33:56.840 --> 33:58.184
We're going to toss for fortune.

33:58.200 --> 33:58.960
Toss for fortune.

33:59.039 --> 33:59.680
All right.

34:00.440 --> 34:00.920
Let's go.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.559
Girls, hold on tight.

34:12.760 --> 34:13.840
Once the fifth watch begins,

34:14.119 --> 34:15.159
I'll count to three.

34:15.280 --> 34:16.719
Then we'll toss it up together.

34:17.119 --> 34:17.639
All right.

34:20.400 --> 34:21.400
Almost there.

34:36.159 --> 34:37.039
It's time.

34:38.599 --> 34:40.840
One, two, three.

34:41.679 --> 34:43.840
- Drop a fortune.
- Drop a fortune.

34:43.840 --> 34:45.840
- Cats come, dogs come.
- Cats come, dogs come.

34:45.840 --> 34:47.840
- The God of Wealth comes to our home.
- The God of Wealth comes to our home.

34:47.840 --> 34:49.760
- Great ingots come rolling in.
- Great ingots come rolling in.

34:49.800 --> 34:52.400
- Little ingots squeeze through the cracks in the door.
- Little ingots squeeze through the cracks in the door.

34:52.440 --> 34:53.679
One, two, three.

35:11.199 --> 35:12.960
The pepper and cypress liquor
from Old Madam.

35:12.960 --> 35:15.000
The sweet dumplings from First Madam.

35:15.039 --> 35:16.719
Everyone, enjoy yourselves.

35:16.800 --> 35:17.960
Eat and drink your fill,

35:17.960 --> 35:19.639
and serve Young Master well next year.

35:19.848 --> 35:23.288
- Thank you, Old Madam and First Madam.
- Thank you, Old Madam and First Madam.

35:23.679 --> 35:24.320
Go get them.

35:24.400 --> 35:25.000
Come quickly.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.280
Sweet dumplings.

35:31.159 --> 35:33.079
This is Young Master's gift for Madam.

35:33.119 --> 35:34.050
Thank you, Young Master.

35:34.079 --> 35:35.880
This is Young Master's gift for you.

35:35.960 --> 35:36.980
Thank you, Young Master.

35:39.840 --> 35:41.280
All right, we'll be going then.

35:41.280 --> 35:42.280
Put it here. Put it here.

35:42.320 --> 35:43.760
Yuchan, smell this. It's so fragrant.

35:44.039 --> 35:44.760
There's so much.

35:44.824 --> 35:45.590
It smells wonderful.

35:45.639 --> 35:46.280
I love these.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.000
I want some.

35:47.010 --> 35:48.270
Come have some sweet dumplings.

35:48.280 --> 35:48.960
Madam Zhang!

35:49.760 --> 35:51.079
- Come quickly.
- All right.

35:51.679 --> 35:53.119
Let's put them on the table.

35:53.159 --> 35:53.679
Let's go.

36:20.800 --> 36:21.880
(First Madam...)

36:21.880 --> 36:23.159
(Live)

36:23.159 --> 36:24.760
(asked me to give this to you.)

36:31.460 --> 36:37.380
(May parents be safe and healthy. Live.)

36:46.980 --> 36:49.180
♪A lone figure
wanders down the old lane♪

36:50.480 --> 36:53.440
(Your unfilial daughter
borrows the fireworks filling the sky)

36:55.239 --> 36:57.719
(to make offerings to Father and Mother)

36:58.480 --> 37:00.280
(and the ancestors of the Shen family.)

37:01.840 --> 37:06.320
(May Father and Mother
be blessed with good health.)

37:09.039 --> 37:14.920
(May I care for my parents as Zilu did,
carrying rice home for them.)

37:14.960 --> 37:17.860
