37:18.220 --> 37:20.580
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

37:20.940 --> 37:27.100
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

37:27.460 --> 37:30.260
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

37:30.620 --> 37:33.100
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

37:33.100 --> 37:40.060
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

37:52.660 --> 37:54.860
♪I walk through winding alleys♪

37:55.820 --> 37:57.980
♪And around weathered corridors♪

37:58.660 --> 38:03.460
♪One moment of peace
brings a little brightness♪

38:05.220 --> 38:07.460
♪I won't forget the long road
that brought me here♪

38:08.140 --> 38:10.580
♪Nor chase
the changing tides of the world♪

38:11.180 --> 38:16.820
♪I only wish
for one gentle ray of light♪

38:17.500 --> 38:20.420
