38:37.599 --> 38:40.719
Great fortune and prosperity!

38:40.720 --> 38:42.008
(Hua, Third-class maid of Zhichun Hall)
I got one!

38:42.239 --> 38:43.719
I got one!

38:45.760 --> 38:46.880
Great fortune and prosperity!

38:46.880 --> 38:48.400
For the Chinese New Year,

38:48.960 --> 38:51.679
great fortune and prosperity!

38:53.079 --> 38:54.239
So beautiful.

38:54.820 --> 38:57.820
