♪And quietly wait for the light♪

39:20.519 --> 39:21.199
Grandfather.

39:29.224 --> 39:31.680
Old Madam saw that these
narcissus flowers were in full bloom,

39:31.800 --> 39:33.880
so she specially asked me
to bring them to you.

39:38.639 --> 39:39.400
Go on.

39:39.800 --> 39:40.639
What is it?

39:42.024 --> 39:44.280
Aunt Lingxiao is worried
about Xiuwan's marriage.

39:44.290 --> 39:46.140
She wants to invite the Xie family over
[*The Festival of Man falls on the seventh day of the first lunar month]

39:46.159 --> 39:47.719
on the Festival of Man to meet her,

39:48.168 --> 39:50.632
but she's worried it would look
too obvious and invite gossip.

39:51.160 --> 39:52.590
So she went to Mother to discuss it.

39:53.079 --> 39:55.000
Mother took Aunt Lingxiao
to ask Old Madam,

39:55.800 --> 39:56.440
and Old Madam

39:57.159 --> 39:58.559
sent me here with these flowers.

40:07.039 --> 40:07.920
I know

40:09.079 --> 40:10.840
you don't want to draw attention

40:11.760 --> 40:12.960
because of my separation.

40:13.864 --> 40:16.072
But back then, because
of our family's circumstances,

40:16.232 --> 40:18.200
my eldest younger sister
was married off in haste.

40:18.760 --> 40:21.480
Old Madam has always regretted it.

40:24.079 --> 40:24.760
Yes.

40:42.119 --> 40:45.239
News arrived from
the northern capital this morning.

40:56.776 --> 40:58.920
His Majesty intends
to appoint Grand Secretary Zhao

41:00.119 --> 41:02.400
as chief compiler
of the Compendium of Literature.

41:03.039 --> 41:04.039
As expected.

41:04.376 --> 41:06.616
Once the imperial decree
is announced after the holiday,

41:06.632 --> 41:09.840
the Zhao family will rise even higher

41:10.199 --> 41:11.639
and become more powerful.

41:12.760 --> 41:15.599
By then, even if
Grand Secretary Zhao does nothing,

41:15.880 --> 41:18.280
there will still be people eager
to curry favor with him

41:18.599 --> 41:19.760
who will make trouble for you.

41:21.760 --> 41:23.000
That's also as expected.

41:24.840 --> 41:27.079
When I gave up
the scholar's path and took up arms,

41:27.599 --> 41:28.840
I knew this day would come.

41:30.280 --> 41:31.760
You once taught me,

41:32.440 --> 41:33.880
misfortune may conceal good fortune,

41:34.040 --> 41:35.670
and good fortune may conceal misfortune.

41:36.199 --> 41:38.800
What seems like misfortune
may yet prove a blessing.

41:48.079 --> 41:48.639
Come.

41:49.119 --> 41:50.239
Write two characters.

41:51.519 --> 41:54.079
Let me see if taking up arms

41:54.559 --> 41:56.920
made you forget what you once learned.

42:30.460 --> 42:35.060
(Farewell to the Old, Welcome the New)

42:37.280 --> 42:39.760
Farewell to the old, welcome the new.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.320
Mother says

42:42.960 --> 42:45.280
marriage is like a woman's second birth.

42:45.640 --> 42:47.000
If she chooses the wrong husband,

42:47.360 --> 42:48.880
she'll suffer for the rest of her life.

42:51.159 --> 42:51.960
Grandfather,

42:52.840 --> 42:53.800
if my situation

42:54.679 --> 42:56.159
delays Xiuwan's marriage,

42:57.280 --> 43:00.400
Mother and I would both feel terrible.

43:04.940 --> 43:07.300
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.000 --> 43:10.159
I heard Congyi
once took a blade for Fengtai.

43:10.320 --> 43:12.159
So Fengtai is going to repay

43:12.159 --> 43:13.920
that life-saving favor with himself?

43:14.039 --> 43:14.840
Right?

43:15.119 --> 43:15.639
Have a drink.

43:15.639 --> 43:16.440
Right?

43:16.519 --> 43:17.039
Come on.

43:19.719 --> 43:20.480
Have a drink.

43:20.480 --> 43:20.880
Come.

43:20.890 --> 43:21.420
Have a drink.

43:21.432 --> 43:22.630
You've got to drink to that.

43:23.079 --> 43:23.880
Right?

43:23.880 --> 43:24.320
Come on.

43:24.320 --> 43:25.239
Have a drink.

43:25.239 --> 43:25.559
Come.

43:25.559 --> 43:25.960
Have one.

43:25.976 --> 43:26.320
Have one.

43:26.320 --> 43:27.280
Come on, come on.

43:27.480 --> 43:27.719
Come.

43:27.720 --> 43:28.216
Come on.

43:28.840 --> 43:31.360
- Have a drink.
- Have a drink.

43:50.280 --> 43:50.800
Today...

