branches once more♪

44:13.300 --> 44:17.820
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:19.100 --> 44:23.020
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:23.700 --> 44:26.460
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:27.180 --> 44:29.500
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:29.500 --> 44:32.580
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:34.100 --> 44:38.340
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:41.260 --> 44:45.420
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:47.220 --> 44:50.780
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:50.780 --> 44:54.340
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:55.140 --> 45:00.820
